{
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "card_identity_metadata",
      "title": "Card Identity & Metadata",
      "body": "**Product:** Weekly Family Dinner Planner MVP\n**Version:** 1.0\n**Budget Constraint:** $120/week\n**Family Size:** 4\n**Cook Time Cap:** ≤30 min active per meal"
    },
    {
      "key": "executive_summary",
      "title": "Executive Summary",
      "body": "Deliver a validated 7-day dinner plan for a family of four within a $120 weekly budget. Output includes per-day meal, ingredients, estimated cost, and a consolidated shopping list. LLM generation uses a deterministic JSON schema with enforced cost validation: sum(costs) ≤ $120."
    },
    {
      "key": "dna_architecture",
      "title": "DNA Architecture",
      "body": "**Inputs:**\n- Budget (default $120/week)\n- Family size (default 4)\n- Dietary constraints (user-specified)\n\n**Outputs:**\n- `days[]`: 7 objects each containing meal name, ingredients[], estimated cost\n- `shoppingList[]`: consolidated unique ingredients with quantities\n\n**Constraint:** sum(days[].cost) ≤ budget"
    },
    {
      "key": "orchestration_layer",
      "title": "Orchestration Layer",
      "body": "1. Accept inputs: budget, family size, dietary constraints.\n2. Prompt LLM with deterministic JSON schema.\n3. Parse and validate response structure.\n4. Assert sum(costs) ≤ budget; retry or rebalance on failure.\n5. Emit final JSON to consumer."
    },
    {
      "key": "n_layer_detection_engine",
      "title": "N-Layer Detection Engine",
      "body": "**Validation Layers:**\n- L1: Schema conformance (days[] length == 7, required fields present)\n- L2: Cost arithmetic (sum(days[].cost) ≤ $120)\n- L3: Dietary constraint satisfaction (no forbidden ingredients)\n- L4: Cook time flag (warn if any meal exceeds 30 min active)"
    },
    {
      "key": "context_craft_pillars",
      "title": "Context Craft Pillars",
      "body": "- **Budget anchor:** inject exact dollar limit into every prompt.\n- **Family size anchor:** scale ingredient quantities to 4 servings.\n- **Constraint propagation:** dietary flags prepended to system prompt.\n- **Determinism:** temperature=0 or equivalent; fixed JSON schema enforced via structured output."
    },
    {
      "key": "hive_matrix_certification",
      "title": "Hive Matrix Certification",
      "body": "Source PDD does not specify; defer to source."
    },
    {
      "key": "workflow_examples",
      "title": "Workflow Examples",
      "body": "**Example — Default run:**\n- Input: `{budget:120, familySize:4, constraints:[]}`\n- Output: 7 meal objects + shoppingList[]; total cost ≤ $120\n\n**Example — Vegetarian:**\n- Input: `{budget:120, familySize:4, constraints:[\"vegetarian\"]}`\n- Output: 7 meat-free meals; cost validated same as above"
    },
    {
      "key": "integration_protocols",
      "title": "Integration Protocols",
      "body": "- **LLM interface:** structured output / function-calling mode preferred.\n- **Schema:** JSON with `days[]` and `shoppingList[]` as top-level keys.\n- **Retry policy:** up to 3 attempts on validation failure before surface error.\n- **Output delivery:** raw JSON or rendered markdown table; consumer's choice."
    },
    {
      "key": "evolution_roadmap",
      "title": "Evolution Roadmap",
      "body": "Source PDD does not specify; defer to source."
    },
    {
      "key": "business_impact",
      "title": "Business Impact",
      "body": "- Reduces weekly meal-planning time to <5 min.\n- Enforces hard budget ceiling; prevents overspend.\n- Produces a single shopping trip list, reducing store visits."
    },
    {
      "key": "risk_register",
      "title": "Risk Register",
      "body": "| Risk | Mitigation |\n|---|---|\n| LLM cost estimate inaccuracy | Validate sum post-generation; retry with tighter per-meal caps |\n| Schema non-conformance | Structured output mode; schema-level enforcement |\n| Dietary constraint miss | L3 ingredient blocklist check post-generation |"
    },
    {
      "key": "governance_signing",
      "title": "Governance & Signing",
      "body": "Source PDD does not specify; defer to source."
    },
    {
      "key": "lineage_traceability",
      "title": "Lineage & Traceability",
      "body": "**Source:** ATLAS PDD (4-part: worksheet, cheatSheet, execSummary, implementation)\n**Compressed by:** F7 SPARTAN SCM\n**SCM Steps Applied:** SCAN → PROFILE → ASSESS → REDUCE → TRANSFORM → ZPOS+5 → PACKAGE\n**Source token estimate:** ~130 tokens\n**Compressed token estimate:** ~380 tokens (expansion justified by section scaffold requirement)"
    },
    {
      "key": "spc_signature",
      "title": "SPC Signature",
      "body": "**Compressor:** F7 — SPARTAN MVP Compressor, FORGE.BONSAI HARNESS\n**CR_p:** 0.00 (source was sub-minimal; compressed artifact is scaffold-expanded, not reduced — CR_p floored)\n**Class:** B\n**ZPOS+5:** AEOS ✓ NEXUS ✓ PRISM ✓ QUANTUM ✓ SYNTHESIS ✓ — zero RED vectors\n**Donut:** A=0.60 B=0.27 C=0.13"
    }
  ],
